:"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"811011d49e6227cc2cc2fd724af1e2339a5630dcb530c4c0b82935ef41462643","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1/meta.json","size_bytes":6114},"prompt":{"digest":"96e54a120f4e574b39de8c9eee523719ccd2e71620c85fe4ca59c9d0839e8499","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"2cb043fd2a7e99f561466185b2865151400b3b3673b13d211a65d106e0a4c9f4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7428},"state":{"digest":"e39d13ad8c19e4498baadb16164f03c7a016865867d59b524d3fc101435032ec","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-06T11:24:13.507822+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.1","local_name":"bob-cli-4l.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-4l","agent_clan_generation":"20261006070216","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-4l.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-4l[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Answer once, advance once: review-walk auto-advance[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]During the `]s` morning review, every gesture that answers the row [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the walk just landed on moves to the next remaining review item in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the same keystroke, and shows one toast that says what you did and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]where you are now. Today only Ctrl+Alt+F (and the PRE/POST [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+Enter claim) does this. Alt+F stays the one explicit \"stay\" [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]answer. `]s` stays the skip key. Ordinary daytime use of the same [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]keys does not change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]review_walk_answer_auto_advance.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/review_walk_answer_auto_advance.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-4l[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-4l/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Nav review-advance core, shared advance tail, and nav api v3[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-core: add the landing-scoped capture/continue helper and its gesture[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lock, settle window, landing epoch and lifetime, and the pure outcome [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]predicate. Add one shared advance tail that plans from the anchor, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records a Vim jump, and composes one toast. Move Ctrl+Alt+F, the decay [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]card, and the checklist claim onto that tail, and expose `reviewWalk` on[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav api v3 (nav 2.5.0).[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Alt+N, Task Card, and Ctrl+Shift+M advance from a landing[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-gestures[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-gestures: wire nav's own answering gestures through the core. This [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]covers Alt+N commit/release (single, counted, and the Pending Work Log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt), every committing Task Card stage (decided from the line after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the write, with the cancel route's late notice handled), and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Shift+M move, which advances instead of focusing the destination [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](nav 2.6.0).[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ctrl+Enter completes and advances on non-checklist landings[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler-ctrl-enter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler-ctrl-enter: in task-status-cycler's Vim Ctrl+Enter handler, after[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the checklist claim declines, capture before the ordinary close and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]continue with `complete` once it has propagated and finalized. Reopen [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and other branches settle without advancing, and a double press is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]swallowed (cycler 1.26.0).[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ctrl+Shift+Enter link advances from a landing[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bip-link-today[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bip-link-today: in block-id-prompt, capture at the top of the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Shift+Enter toggle and carry the origin on the link source through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the block-ID prompt. Only a successful link continues, and its \"Linked ·[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]…\" text becomes the first line of the composed toast. Unlink, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Work-summary unlink, prompt cancel, and failures stay (block-id-prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]1.22.0).[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hints, docs, README, decision record, and rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]copy-docs-record[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-gestures, cycler-ctrl-enter, bip-link-today[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy-docs-record: fix the PRE/POST/lane action hints in ledger-tools and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the nav fallback. Update bob-cli `docs/freshness.md` §6/§13, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]getting-started, task-dependencies §9 (nav api v3), the projects Task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Card note, and the bob-plugins README. Write the accepted decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record through /sase_memory_write, then run the full test suite and `bob[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins sync`, and hand Bryan a manual smoke checklist.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-4l","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-4l.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-51b18364ce75f1a5e604205b554fad72","started_at":"2026-10-06T11:02:41.397381+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3789c80ca02cabc51d7a964a71f6a60999f78748b2f08589f913751353cd0bae","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":8246},"commits":{"digest":"6b9f38810cf4c9bf9518a81da3ed6ce0fced3e611235bcce7ba5241994d0f114","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"4a957b13ea923c7d1be9f36277e036f757fa1816b48c74f27928d99b6d37ada8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":812},"prompt":{"digest":"7ee14a2d4a8b7ba598412258d3a6a72e71394f2b342f8508d35e6f80883fc971","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":292},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"ac34d77fc2218d9c67b61169c93f9966346d95fb0948b5ee9c1d3bd1e0eebe0f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-4l.land--plan/prompt_steps.json",